    "Name": "Fulcrum II",
    "Details": "The Fulcrum Hover Tank was first brought into production by Cyclops Incorporation of Skye in 3057. The vehicle was initially stationed along the Lyran Alliance's Periphery and Free Worlds League borders, where its low maintenance needs were a boon for worlds that had not seen much of the newest technological advances. The vehicle had continued to perform well during the FedCom Civil War and during the early Jihad.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 10/15 hexes / 300/450 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       250     25\n<b>Left</b>         135     25\n<b>Right</b>       135     25\n<b>Rear</b>        100     25\n<b>Turret</b>      210     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      830    125</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Agile</color>",
    "Icon": "Fulcrum"
  },
